 PROGRESS.md    | 7 ++++++-
 src/segment.rs | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/PROGRESS.md b/PROGRESS.md
index ccdcb53..2c4e35a 100644
--- a/PROGRESS.md
+++ b/PROGRESS.md
@@ -25,8 +25,13 @@ Each source branch has an EXPERIMENT.md (design, toggle env var names, hook poin
   never sees a segment). Split `run(size)` into `load(size)` + `run(size)` to reuse the fixture.
   Passes.
 
+- Toggles ON (`TRIPLOX_BATCHED_JOIN=1 TRIPLOX_SEGMENT_SIZE=256`): 615 lib + 32 integration, all pass.
+- `cargo clippy -p triplox --all-targets`: clean. (Both toggles are read at runtime from env, so
+  clippy output cannot differ between arms; one run covers both.)
+- `cargo fmt` applied.
+
 ## Next
-1. Full suite with all toggles on (running).
+1. Interleaved bench (script: scratchpad/run-combo-bench.sh), 3 passes x 4 arms, RUNS=5.
 2. Interleaved bench: off / batched-only / segments-only / all-on, 3 passes.
 3. COMBINED.md.
 
diff --git a/src/segment.rs b/src/segment.rs
